==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Metal Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'Behemoth]] spawns as the boss after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*10 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 0.67~1 seconds<sup>20f~30f</sup>.
*3 [[Metal Doge]]s spawn after 70 seconds<sup>2,100f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*10 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 0.67~1 seconds<sup>20f~30f</sup>.
*10 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 183.33 seconds<sup>5,500f</sup>, delay 0.67~1 seconds<sup>20f~30f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Despite the strength of Le'Behemoth, no Shield Pierce units are needed here, nor are crit units due to the relatively low amount of Metal Doges at low magnification. Still, you should bring a way to deal with the occasional 10 Cerberus Kid spam waves.

